      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-08T23:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, everyone over 10 hp except scholar.</p><p>Tempest sent his first oft back anddrew Cleansing Downpour. from that point on, he was on healing duty.</p><p>used the first Keep Moving I saw to get mortal form to Energy to get some heal zapping going.&nbsp;</p><p>Unity got a Scrap Metal for Gift-mas, allowing a free play of Swift Bot. Cro bot got some shots in, and some raptors and platforms made an appearance.&nbsp;</p><p>finished off Ratso with the Know When to Cut loose/ Channel combo. (Hence Scholar's end-game hp total being on the low side)</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:09:41.022Z",
