      "created_at": "2016-11-09T05:56:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, but barely. &nbsp;Scholar was the only hero left alive. &nbsp;But it turns out that the \"Deal 3 to heal 3\" power that Infected heroes get is pretty great for Scholar. &nbsp;Plague Rat isn't a particularly good matchup for tanks, but if you have to be down to one hero with no end in sight, Scholar's your man!</p>",
